    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Happy Halloween!"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Thank you to all the talented photographers who submitted their work to Deep Shadows , an online exhibition celebrating the mysteries of Halloween. Drawing from urban legends, Victorian-era lore, and the uncanny, the selected images evoke nostalgia and unease through haunting portraits, strange landscapes, and allusions to magic. Selecting just fifty photographs from hundreds of submissions was a challenge. Each chosen image invites viewers into a world where stories unfold through suggestion and ambiguity, revealing how much can be communicated by limiting what is seen and leaving the rest to the imagination."
    },
