    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Douglas Breaul t is an interdisciplinary artist who overlaps elements of photography, painting, sculpture, and video. His work has been collected, published, and exhibited nationally and internationally, including at the MFA Boston, the Addison Gallery of American Art, the Czong Institute for Contemporary Art (South Korea), Space Place Gallery (Russia), the Bristol Art Museum, and the Rochester Museum of Fine Arts. In addition to being an artist, Breault writes about art, curates exhibitions, and teaches photography at different colleges.",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Douglas Breaul",
          "url": "https://www.douglasbreault.com/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Follow Douglas Breault on Instagram: @dug_bro",
      "links": [
